title: "CrossTeamsAI"
abstract: >
  An LLM-based pipeline for meeting summarization (Phase 1), causal modeling
  of project bottlenecks (Phase 2), AI-generated model-card documentation
  (Phase 3), and a knowledge graph + dashboard (Phase 4), bundled into a
  single integrated architecture (Phase 5).
